{"3789230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kalit", "steam_appid": 3789230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a massive 1930s cartoon open world where everything is out to get you. <strong>Hunt, capture, and command</strong> quirky creatures to fight your battles and automate your base. <strong>Climb</strong> every mountain, <strong>glide</strong> across the map, and <strong>shoot</strong> down wacky enemies. You'll need to <strong>scavenge</strong> resources, <strong>farm</strong> crops, and <strong>manage</strong> your sanity and body temperature to survive the wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/9ad574c698e890c4736def64409106c1.poster.avif?t=1784375469\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/9ad574c698e890c4736def64409106c1.webm?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/9ad574c698e890c4736def64409106c1.mp4?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Submerge yourself and explore an underwater world filled with shipwrecks, hidden resources, and lurking dangers.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your base underwater, explore the deep seas, and discover water creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/5a92a133ccc25d80e2bb5a3a0310ffe1.poster.avif?t=1784375469\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/5a92a133ccc25d80e2bb5a3a0310ffe1.webm?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/5a92a133ccc25d80e2bb5a3a0310ffe1.mp4?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hand-drawn 1930s Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the world come alive! Every animation is painstakingly hand-drawn using the classic &quot;rubber hose&quot; technique, bringing nostalgic cartoon charm into a fully 3D environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/b97a3628df20bbf0f19ea8e8a47244c8.poster.avif?t=1784375469\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/b97a3628df20bbf0f19ea8e8a47244c8.webm?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/b97a3628df20bbf0f19ea8e8a47244c8.mp4?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Uncover Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land and sea depths await you! Venture through bizarre lands, track down hidden minigames, and dig deep into pitch-black mines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/7dfd066b9071c2fea6926a101552a113.poster.avif?t=1784375469\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/7dfd066b9071c2fea6926a101552a113.webm?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/7dfd066b9071c2fea6926a101552a113.mp4?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/9e31c94c4b90ffc6a2f13b2189532385.poster.avif?t=1784375469\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/9e31c94c4b90ffc6a2f13b2189532385.webm?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/9e31c94c4b90ffc6a2f13b2189532385.mp4?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all creatures are friendly! Craft vintage-flavored weapons, including guns that look like they're straight out of an old cartoon, and prepare for explosive encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/14949a0fd97c21a4bd747761ef9852c8.poster.avif?t=1784375469\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/14949a0fd97c21a4bd747761ef9852c8.webm?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/14949a0fd97c21a4bd747761ef9852c8.mp4?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect &amp; Command Creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bizarre creatures of this world can become your greatest allies. Tame the local wildlife to help you in exploration, base defense, and resource gathering. With the right care, you'll see them evolve into even more extravagant and powerful forms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/b8f4d00c77c06762ffb2c5cddc7dc733.poster.avif?t=1784375469\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/b8f4d00c77c06762ffb2c5cddc7dc733.webm?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/b8f4d00c77c06762ffb2c5cddc7dc733.mp4?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Eccentric Locals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't the only one wandering this wild island! Seek out and talk to a cast of wacky, fully-animated characters. Chat with the locals to uncover hidden lore, take on peculiar quests, and trade for rare, valuable items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/12d7b206db7598782e2b7b35db8eb635.poster.avif?t=1784375469\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/12d7b206db7598782e2b7b35db8eb635.webm?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/12d7b206db7598782e2b7b35db8eb635.mp4?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather, Mine &amp; Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An axe with eyes? Sure! Chop down trees, or arm yourself with your trusty pickaxe to extract precious shiny metals. Use your resources to build a custom base with automated defenses, or assemble incredible vehicles with a retro touch—from mechs that roam the mainland to flying machines that rule the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/f80b6a1fd803b83ed02e3488b8e512ad.poster.avif?t=1784375469\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/f80b6a1fd803b83ed02e3488b8e512ad.webm?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/f80b6a1fd803b83ed02e3488b8e512ad.mp4?t=1784375469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive &amp; Farm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this wacky world, hunger and thirst are just the beginning! You will need to fight off the freezing cold, beat the blistering heat, and keep your sanity from dropping into madness. Plant quirky seeds, tend to animated saplings, and harvest crops to keep your energy up for new adventures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience 1930s cartoon chaos:</strong> A beautiful, fully hand-drawn &quot;rubber hose&quot; art style set in a massive 3D environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture and command creatures:</strong> Catch bizarre local wildlife to fight alongside you or automate your base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a massive open world:</strong> Climb any surface, glide through the skies, and swim through deep waters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to wacky NPCs:</strong> Meet a cast of quirky locals to trade, accept quests, and learn the secrets of the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and craft:</strong> Mine deep for precious ores, refine materials, and construct your ultimate retro base and vehicles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master survival mechanics:</strong> Manage your hunger, temperature, and keep your sanity from dropping into madness!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm, fish, and forage:</strong> Plant seeds, irrigate crops, and cast your fishing line to keep starvation at bay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot and smash enemies:</strong> Craft wacky weapons and blast your way through hostile wildlife, aggressive mobs, and giant bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up:</strong> Gain XP and unlock new abilities and recipes in a deep progression system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the Community!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are an indie studio formed by two video game enthusiasts. The game is currently in the <strong>very early stages</strong> of development, and your feedback is vital in helping us shape it. Come say hello, share your ideas, and follow our progress by joining our community on Discord!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a massive 1930s cartoon open world where everything is out to get you. <strong>Hunt, capture, and command</strong> quirky creatures to fight your battles and automate your base. <strong>Climb</strong> every mountain, <strong>glide</strong> across the map, and <strong>shoot</strong> down wacky enemies. You'll need to <strong>scavenge</strong> resources, <strong>farm</strong> crops, and <strong>manage</strong> your sanity and body temperature to survive the wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shar